If You draw benefits under Flexi-access Drawdown the limits set by the Finance Act 2004 and the requirement to review these limits do not apply. You can draw Your income under Flexi-access Drawdown as a one off lump sum, a series of single payments or on a regular basis (i.e. paid on a monthly, quarterly, half-yearly or yearly basis.). If You have not already started to draw Benefits as Income Drawdown, the only method by which You may do so is Flexi-access Drawdown.
